Account & Data Deletion Policy

Highway Runner
Developer: Dreamup Studio
Effective Date: 18 August 2026
Last Updated: 18 August 2026

Dreamup Studio provides players of Highway Runner with a way to request deletion of their account and associated personal information.

1. Requesting Account Deletion
Where an account deletion option is available inside Highway Runner, you may initiate deletion through that feature.
You may also submit a deletion request by email.
Send your request to:
support.dreamup@gmail.com
Use the subject:
Highway Runner – Account Deletion Request
Please provide sufficient information to identify the Highway Runner account you want deleted, such as your registered email address or player/account identifier.
Never send your password.

2. Verification
To protect players from unauthorized account deletion, Dreamup Studio may take reasonable steps to verify that the person requesting deletion is the account owner.
Additional information may be requested where necessary to verify the request.

3. Information That May Be Deleted
Depending on the information associated with your account, deletion may include:
•	Highway Runner account information;
•	Email address associated with the Highway Runner account;
•	Player profile information;
•	Stored game progress associated with the account;
•	Account-linked scores;
•	Leaderboard information associated with the account, where technically and legally appropriate; and
•	Other personal information associated with the account that Dreamup Studio is not required or permitted to retain.
The exact data affected depends on the Highway Runner features and services used by the player.

4. Leaderboard Information
Deleting an account may result in the player's name and associated leaderboard information being deleted, anonymized or otherwise disassociated from the deleted account where appropriate.
Technical limitations of third-party leaderboard systems may affect how historical leaderboard information is removed.

5. Information That May Be Retained
Certain limited information may be retained after an account deletion request where necessary or permitted for:
•	Legal compliance;
•	Security;
•	Fraud and abuse prevention;
•	Enforcement of our Terms of Service;
•	Resolving disputes;
•	Financial or transaction records where legally required; or
•	Backup and disaster-recovery systems for a limited period.
Information retained for these purposes will not be used to continue normal operation of the deleted player account.

6. Processing Time
Dreamup Studio will process valid deletion requests within a reasonable period and within any timeframe required by applicable law.
Additional time may be necessary where identity or account ownership needs to be verified or where technical limitations apply.

7. Consequences of Account Deletion
Account deletion may be permanent.
Once deletion has been completed, you may lose access to:
•	Your Highway Runner account;
•	Saved progress;
•	High scores;
•	Leaderboard records;
•	Achievements;
•	Account-linked settings; and
•	Other information associated with the deleted account.
Deleted information may not be recoverable.

8. Guest Accounts
Guest accounts may work differently from registered accounts.
Depending on how guest information is stored, deleting Highway Runner or clearing application data may remove locally stored guest information.
Where guest information is stored by Dreamup Studio or a service provider and can be associated with a particular player, you may contact us for assistance with a deletion request.

9. Third-Party Accounts
Deleting a Highway Runner account does not necessarily delete your separate Google, Facebook or other third-party account.
Similarly, deleting or disconnecting a third-party account does not necessarily constitute a request to delete information held by Highway Runner.
You may need to manage information held independently by third-party providers through their own account and privacy controls.

10. Questions About Data Deletion
For questions concerning account or personal data deletion, contact:
Dreamup Studio
Game: Highway Runner
Email: support.dreamup@gmail.com
